<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-093-B habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.430055" lon="-120.929734"><name>SC26-093-B</name><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 6.4 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 65/100; not catch probability. Center 41 ft; nearby 41–65 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Parallel bands visible in survey rendering; confirm small-scale relief by sonar. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-074</name><desc>Partial mapped habitat footprint clipped to a 225-m search window to retain complete depth coverage; not the entire reef or a single pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.430769267241274" lon="-120.93197356816869"/><trkpt lat="35.430763607902726" lon="-120.93164328154253"/><trkpt lat="35.4308537169694" lon="-120.93164097648808"/><trkpt lat="35.43085183031638" lon="-120.93153088084398"/><trkpt lat="35.43112215748879" lon="-120.93152396525173"/><trkpt lat="35.43112745888523" lon="-120.9318333411331"/><trkpt lat="35.43121670219864" lon="-120.93176484380395"/><trkpt lat="35.431649185927945" lon="-120.93126537409364"/><trkpt lat="35.43194437732495" lon="-120.93063401597078"/><trkpt lat="35.432082451432386" lon="-120.92968208730012"/><trkpt lat="35.431911857055056" lon="-120.92873806299127"/><trkpt lat="35.43145856771375" lon="-120.92794567136349"/><trkpt lat="35.43079159663678" lon="-120.92742555000076"/><trkpt lat="35.43001248775744" lon="-120.92725687793316"/><trkpt lat="35.429239854442535" lon="-120.9274653241202"/><trkpt lat="35.42859132103695" lon="-120.92801914534543"/><trkpt lat="35.42816561683822" lon="-1